{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Ndipo Ayubu akajibu:"},{"verse":2,"text":"“Hata leo malalamiko yangu ni chungu;"},{"verse":3,"text":"Laiti ningefahamu mahali pa kumwona;"},{"verse":4,"text":"Ningeliweka shauri langu mbele zake,"},{"verse":5,"text":"Ningejua kwamba angenijibu nini,"},{"verse":6,"text":"Je, angenipinga kwa nguvu nyingi?"},{"verse":7,"text":"Hapo mtu mwadilifu angeweka shauri lake mbele zake,"},{"verse":8,"text":"“Lakini nikienda mashariki, hayupo;"},{"verse":9,"text":"Anapokuwa kazini pande za kaskazini, simwoni;"},{"verse":10,"text":"Lakini anaijua njia niiendeayo;"},{"verse":11,"text":"Nyayo zangu zimefuata hatua zake kwa karibu;"},{"verse":12,"text":"Sijaziacha amri zilizotoka midomoni mwake;"},{"verse":13,"text":"“Lakini yeye husimama peke yake; ni nani awezaye kumpinga?"},{"verse":14,"text":"Hutimiliza maagizo yake dhidi yangu,"},{"verse":15,"text":"Hiyo ndiyo sababu ninaingiwa na hofu mbele zake;"},{"verse":16,"text":"Mungu ameufanya moyo wangu kuzimia;"},{"verse":17,"text":"Hata hivyo sijanyamazishwa na giza,"}]}